<!-- honesty-ledger
Source: domain-planner/SKILL.md, domain-planner/references/orchestration-workflow.md, domain-scaffolder/SKILL.md, domain-reviewer/SKILL.md, domain-reviewer/references/orchestration-workflow.md
Unit and denominator: domain-* process contracts across the three public skills
Transform: skill contracts mirrored into linked Mermaid charts for review and navigation
Filter or category selection: implementation-code details omitted; process contracts, gates, handoffs, artifacts, and loops retained
Axis/domain: entry chart positions workflow left to right; child charts use status severity and handoff dependency order
Caveat: this MMDX is a decision and navigation surface, not a replacement for the canonical SKILL.md files
-->

## chart main Domain Star Process Decision Surface
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  start["RECOMMENDED: run domain-* as a gated slice factory"]
  context["Context resolver"]
  plan["Plan gate"]
  implement["Implementation loop"]
  review["Review and retire"]
  done["DONE: audited, hardened, retired slice"]
  artifacts["Artifact map"]
  risks["Risk gates"]

  start --> context --> plan --> implement --> review --> done
  context -. "every mode depends on this" .-> artifacts
  plan -. "writes canonical plan" .-> artifacts
  implement -. "consumes plan and br epic" .-> artifacts
  review -. "writes audit and completion record" .-> artifacts
  risks -. "can halt or reshape" .-> plan
  risks -. "can block closure" .-> review

  classDef high fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef low fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#0c4a6e,stroke-width:1px
  classDef unknown fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#6b7280,color:#111827,stroke-dasharray: 4 3
  classDef neutral fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#64748b,color:#0f172a
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  classDef recommended fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b,stroke-width:3px
  class start,done recommended
  class context,artifacts neutral
  class plan,implement,review decision
  class risks med
```

## chart context-resolver Context Resolver
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  cwd["Input: CWD + slice name or handoff"]
  snapshot["OK: run domain_context_snapshot"]
  overlay{"Client overlay matches?"}
  matched["OK: context.yaml gives plan roots, repos, conventions, auth"]
  noOverlay["BLOCKED: no overlay for orchestration"]
  explicit["LOW: explicit plan paths allowed for read or plan-only work"]
  askCreate["MED: ask to create overlay via skillbox quickstart"]
  noSearch["HIGH: do not search filesystem for plans"]
  result["Context is resolved before planning, scaffolding, or audit"]

  cwd --> snapshot --> overlay
  overlay -->|yes| matched --> result
  overlay -->|no, planning only| explicit --> result
  overlay -->|no, implementation| noOverlay --> askCreate --> result
  noOverlay --> noSearch

  classDef high fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef low fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#0c4a6e,stroke-width:1px
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  classDef recommended fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b,stroke-width:3px
  class snapshot,matched,result ok
  class overlay decision
  class noOverlay,noSearch high
  class askCreate med
  class explicit low
```

## chart plan-gate Planning Gate
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  trigger["Trigger: new slice or existing plan"]
  existing{"Plan exists?"}
  prereq["OK: pre-planning prerequisites"]
  phases["Phase depth"]
  questions["Question cascade"]
  quality["Plan quality loop"]
  checkpoint["OK: review.mmdx human checkpoint"]
  beads["OK: post-signoff br epic"]
  accepted["READY: accepted slice contract"]

  trigger --> existing
  existing -->|new plan| prereq --> phases
  existing -->|continue planning| phases
  existing -->|check quality| quality
  existing -->|implement it| accepted
  phases --> questions --> quality --> checkpoint --> beads --> accepted

  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  classDef recommended fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b,stroke-width:3px
  class existing decision
  class prereq,checkpoint,beads ok
  class phases,questions,quality med
  class accepted recommended
```

## chart phase-depth Planner Phase Depth
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  pre["Pre: build-vs-clone, docs freshness, external gate if needed"]
  p0["0 Landscape: INDEX + sibling shared.md/schema"]
  p05["0.5 Core Value Gate: actor, visible win, minimum slice"]
  p1["1 Discovery: user stories with acceptance tests"]
  p2["2 Contract: shared.md endpoints, shapes, errors locked"]
  p3["3 Backend: rules, permissions, schema.mmd"]
  p4["4 Frontend: screens, states, flows.md"]
  p5["5 Strategy: tradeoffs, rejected options, non-goals"]
  p55["5.5 Deep review: apr or fallback"]
  p6["6 Signoff: deep review, 100/100 quality, review.mmdx, save, br epic"]

  pre --> p0 --> p05 --> p1 --> p2 --> p3 --> p4 --> p5 --> p55 --> p6
  p05 -. "scope filter" .-> p1
  p2 -. "contract lock" .-> p3
  p2 -. "contract lock" .-> p4
  p6 -. "handoff" .-> p2

  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef high fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  class pre,p55 med
  class p05,p2,p6 high
  class p0,p1,p3,p4,p5 ok
```

## chart question-cascade Question Cascade
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  outcome["1 Core outcome: what visible win?"]
  story["2 Story scope: CRUD, view-only, assignment, or flow?"]
  endpoint["3 Endpoint shape: combined or separate?"]
  data["4 Data model: references, ownership, history?"]
  access["5 Access control: inferred auth, owner, shared, admin?"]
  frontend["6 Frontend access pattern: inline widget or page?"]
  accept["7 Acceptance tests: happy, validation, auth, not found, conflict"]
  stop["OK: ask only genuine uncertainties"]

  outcome --> story --> endpoint --> data --> access --> frontend --> accept --> stop
  outcome -. "cuts low-value scope" .-> accept
  data -. "sibling FK check" .-> access
  access -. "drives UI visibility" .-> frontend

  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  class outcome,story,endpoint,data,access,frontend decision
  class accept,stop ok
```

## chart plan-quality-loop Plan Quality Loop
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  files["Input: 6 plan files"]
  assess["Assess against 10 dimensions"]
  score{"Score is 100/100?"}
  fix["Fix cited issues only"]
  reassess["Re-assess fresh"]
  max{"3 rounds reached?"}
  pass["READY: structural plan quality clean"]
  escalate["BLOCKED: escalate remaining design decisions"]

  files --> assess --> score
  score -->|yes| pass
  score -->|no| fix --> reassess --> score
  score --> max
  max -->|yes and still below 100| escalate

  classDef high fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  class files,assess,fix,reassess ok
  class score,max decision
  class pass ok
  class escalate high
```

## chart implementation-loop Implementation Loop
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  accepted["Input: accepted plan + br epic"]
  scope["Analyze repos and surfaces"]
  wg["Beads depth"]
  launch["Launch scaffolder workers by repo/surface"]
  scaffold["Scaffolder depth"]
  audit["Domain-reviewer audit"]
  score{"Audit score 100/100?"}
  fix["Fix workers from AUDIT_REPORT handoffs"]
  harden["Hardening depth"]
  done["READY: index DONE and retire"]

  accepted --> scope --> wg --> launch --> scaffold --> audit --> score
  score -->|no| fix --> audit
  score -->|yes| harden --> done

  classDef high fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  class accepted,scope,wg,launch,scaffold,audit,harden ok
  class score decision
  class fix med
  class done ok
```

## chart beads-depth Beads Execution Graph
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  wg["br epic"]
  node["Each child issue is a self-contained executable brief"]
  fields["Required: issue id, concern label, repo label, dependencies, writes design, acceptance criteria, validation notes, risk label, status"]
  context["Must embed context, contract excerpt, acceptance criteria, rationale"]
  deps["Dependency edges define ready frontier"]
  writes["Writes globs define parallel safety"]
  readme["Optional README update node when positioning changes"]
  wave["READY: agents can execute without re-deriving plan intent"]

  wg --> node --> fields --> context --> wave
  wg --> deps --> wave
  wg --> writes --> wave
  wg --> readme --> wave

  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  class wg,node,fields,context,deps,writes,wave ok
  class readme med
```

## chart scaffolder-depth Scaffolder Depth
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  input["Input: existing slice plan"]
  surface{"surface=backend or frontend?"}
  backend["Backend: service tests, route tests, models, schemas, repository, service, router, migration"]
  frontend["Frontend: patterns, types, API service, hooks, components, widget or page"]
  validateB["Backend validation: tests pass, migration exists, router registered"]
  validateF["Frontend validation: type/build/lint pass, states handled, patterns reused"]
  handoff["Audit handoff names domain-reviewer, slice, surface, plan path, commands, risks"]

  input --> surface
  surface -->|backend| backend --> validateB --> handoff
  surface -->|frontend| frontend --> validateF --> handoff

  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  class input,backend,frontend,validateB,validateF,handoff ok
  class surface decision
```

## chart hardening-depth Hardening Depth
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  compliant["Audit 100/100"]
  scope["Scope files from br issue writes"]
  crap["Run /crap on touched files only"]
  score{"FINAL_SCORE <= 30?"}
  mutate["Run /mutate on top 3 hotspots and add tests"]
  pass["READY: proceed to retirement"]
  fail["BLOCKED: report surviving hotspots and ask accept or fix"]
  skip["LOW: skip only if user explicitly requested"]

  compliant --> scope --> crap --> score
  score -->|yes| pass
  score -->|no| mutate --> crap
  mutate --> fail
  compliant --> skip

  classDef high fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef low fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#0c4a6e,stroke-width:1px
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  class compliant,scope,crap,pass ok
  class score decision
  class mutate high
  class fail high
  class skip low
```

## chart review-retire Review And Retire
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  trigger["Trigger: audit, review, retire, close out, session consolidation"]
  mode{"Mode?"}
  audit["Audit loop depth"]
  stall["Stall triage depth"]
  retire["Retirement depth"]
  session["Retire-session: consolidate DONE session plans"]
  complete["DONE: lean completion artifact and updated index"]

  trigger --> mode
  mode -->|audit| audit --> stall --> retire --> complete
  mode -->|retire| retire --> complete
  mode -->|retire-session| session --> complete

  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  class mode decision
  class audit,retire,session,complete ok
  class stall med
```

## chart audit-loop-depth Audit Loop Depth
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  start["Start audit with plan, code, standards"]
  audit["Worker writes AUDIT_REPORT.md"]
  parse["Orchestrator parses Overall Compliance Score"]
  score{"100/100?"}
  handoffs["Extract Agent Handoffs"]
  fixB["Backend fix worker if needed"]
  fixF["Frontend fix worker if needed"]
  rereview["Re-review against previous report and git diff"]
  done["READY: retire"]

  start --> audit --> parse --> score
  score -->|yes| done
  score -->|no| handoffs
  handoffs --> fixB --> rereview --> parse
  handoffs --> fixF --> rereview

  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  class start,audit,parse,rereview,done ok
  class score decision
  class handoffs,fixB,fixF med
```

## chart stall-triage-depth Stall Triage Depth
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  stall["Stall: less than 2 point gain, repeated issue, or 5 iterations"]
  classify["Classify every remaining issue"]
  actionable["ACTIONABLE: retarget worker with sharper instructions"]
  regressing["REGRESSING: retry once with combined context"]
  stale["STALE: escalate, do not mark DONE below 100"]
  external["EXTERNAL: auth gap, upstream API, missing package"]
  report["Output specific stall report with trajectory and recommendation"]

  stall --> classify
  classify --> actionable --> report
  classify --> regressing --> report
  classify --> stale --> report
  classify --> external --> report

  classDef high fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  class stall,stale,external high
  class classify,regressing,report med
  class actionable ok
```

## chart retirement-depth Retirement Depth
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  compliant["Input: 100/100 compliant implementation"]
  investigate["Read plan, AUDIT_REPORT, git diff, completed evidence"]
  categorize["Categorize stories: complete, deferred, not built"]
  completed["Write lean COMPLETED.md"]
  prune["Remove bloat from completion docs"]
  index["Update INDEX.md to DONE"]
  archive["Retire-session can archive completed session plans"]
  done["DONE: future readers know what shipped and what did not"]

  compliant --> investigate --> categorize --> completed --> prune --> index --> done
  archive --> index

  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef low fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#0c4a6e,stroke-width:1px
  class compliant,investigate,categorize,completed,prune,index,done ok
  class archive low
```

## chart artifact-map Artifact Map
