```mermaid
flowchart TD
  start["Risk gates can reshape or stop a slice"]
  build["Build-vs-clone: adopt, clone, extract, or build"]
  docs["Docs freshness: README and vision drift"]
  external["External reality depth"]
  auth["Auth scope depth"]
  delivery["Delivery strategy: big-bang target state by default"]
