  class docs,delivery,perf med
  class start,result ok
```

## chart external-reality-depth External Reality Depth
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  unknown["Question depends on current outside facts"]
  escalate["Call escalate with exact decision at risk"]
  route{"Route?"}
  thesis["thesis-gtm: buyer, ICP, wedge, pricing, packaging"]
  research["deep-research-prompt: vendor, platform, regulation, API fact"]
  web["web-check: bounded current-source check"]
  skip["skip: record reason"]
  broad["too-broad: narrow before Phase 0"]
  wiki["If durable finding and wiki exists, ingest note"]
  carry["Carry constraints into landscape and Core Value Gate"]

  unknown --> escalate --> route
  route --> thesis --> carry
  route --> research --> wiki --> carry
  route --> web --> wiki
  route --> skip --> carry
  route --> broad --> unknown

  classDef high fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  class unknown,broad high
  class escalate,thesis,research,web,wiki,carry ok
  class route decision
  class skip med
```

## chart auth-scope-depth Auth Scope Depth
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  slice["Slice touches auth, payments, or identity"]
  source["Canonical source: auth packages from client overlay"]
  reuse["OK: reuse existing packages first"]
  gap{"Capability missing?"}
  proposal["BLOCKED: auth-scope proposal with gap, API/package, impacted slice, cross-product benefit"]
  local["MED: temporary local symlink/link for unpublished package changes"]
  live["OK: final validation against published/live auth packages"]
  reject["HIGH: reject parallel local auth/payments/identity layer"]
  close["READY: compliant auth scope"]

  slice --> source --> reuse --> gap
  gap -->|no| close
  gap -->|yes| proposal --> local --> live --> close
  reuse --> reject

  classDef high fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  class source,reuse,live,close ok
  class gap decision
  class proposal,reject high
  class local med
```
